{"id": "DKwVxOasW2R", "title": "Video by meta_morph_award", "description": "Meta Morph AI Film Award: Audience Choice Winners \n\nThis year, we decided to do something different, allowing people to vote for their favourite projects!\n\nWinner: Forreal by Donavan Ratnasingam\nA high-energy hip-hop track, the first generative AI music video by a major recording artist from the SEA region—English and Tamil—with bold lyrics that celebrate authenticity, ambition, and cultural pride. \n\nRunner Up: The Last Track by Oscar Sanchez\nIn a peaceful forest, a porcelain fox runs through the terrain, symbolising the fragility of life.\n\nCongratulations to our Audience Choice winners, we couldn’t be prouder to announce this new award and feature your work! Thank you to all submissions this year, it’s been one to remember!\n\n#MetaMorphAward2025 #Filmfestival #aifilmfestival", "channel": "meta_morph_award", "uploader_id": "59481793976", "uploader": "Meta Morph Award", "timestamp": 1749633883, "like_count": 32, "comment_count": 2, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/149.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1260808635428676a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 55.807, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNmtgW7M9Z_kbbgXsBrkO2gzZ7epqvTZglKdOrCv8PgRw6ElFRX3i316MpTDeXtS9KoFupa5gn5FRRsBDChRKG2.mp4?_nc_cat=102&_nc_oc=AdpSWl1UvCggPatNG5shrmlQT5Ijn2gD5HnuoKO2xalYD-K5GogaLFrggENh7NivyxVH7sNxI8-HHk2lWm99-Ozm&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=pg-dS1M2KvkQ7kNvwGR_YtF&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=FjOYoUCEilN5vJ_QJU7hqA&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=